  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLC_Market &amp; Sustainability Lead</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lumphat, Mundulkiri, Ratanakiri

Activity 1.6: Facilitate institutional strengthening for the Chey Otdam Natural Cashew Community (CONCC), including developing benefit-sharing mechanisms and financial management systems. Activity 1.6.1 &#x2013; Support Monthly Meeting of the Producer Management Team. 1.6.2 &#x2013; Support to Develop a Benefit-Sharing Mechanism. 1.6.3 &#x2013; Training on Financial Management. Activity 1.6.4: Develop a deforestation-free cashew protocol. Activity 1.6.5: Implement and enforce the Internal Control System (ICS) for sustainability standards. Activity 1.6.6 &#x2013; ICS Meeting

Activity 2.1: Develop small-scale processing capacity.  Activity 2.1 &#x2013; Training on Machine Management and Production (Lumphat), Activity 2.1.1 &#x2013; Feasibility Study to Developthe Final Product, Activity 2.1.2 Market Linkage Platform and Contract Farming Development (Meeting with Buyer to Secure Premium Price), Activity 2.2: Create market linkages, branding, and packaging solutions. Activity 2.2.2 &#x2013; Support NLC Social Enterprise to Buy Deforestation-Free Cashew, Produce Final Product, and Market It</narrative>
  </description>
